{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose Your Duelist, Unravel the Mystery!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gensokyo faces a new Incident: a sudden craze for card duels! What secret lies behind?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the shrine maiden and expert in Incident resolving, Reimu sets out to investigate\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yet, charging recklessly would be a bit unwise. Get prepared through practice matches first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What's in this Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tutorial Mode:</strong> Learn the basics and get ready for battle.<br><strong>Practice Mode:</strong> Enjoy fast-paced practice matches, experience the joy of card duels.<br><strong>Puzzle Mode:</strong> Put your brain to the test! Can you defeat your opponent in a single turn?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Please note that all content is still under development.<br>* Some illustrations are temporary and will be gradually replaced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">And There\u2019s More!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo is just a part of what\u2019s to come!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We plan to continuously update this demo, until it is ready to be released as the Early Access version. Stay tuned!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3843480?t=1752946805","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3843480?t=1752946805","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843480/54225dde21a42bf12ff694a8bdf7fe9867ff31b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752946805","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843480/54225dde21a42bf12ff694a8bdf7fe9867ff31b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752946805","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Custom V